<!-- KLIC native HTML example. Styles/interactions: component bundle. Pattern reference: https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/blob/481d523374745e77d0cf9c53a4115ab5dd7c8481/apps/v4/examples/base/switch-choice-card.tsx -->
<div data-kv-root data-klic-material="surface" data-kv-component="toggle" data-kv-variant="notification-card" data-klic-component="toggle" class="kn-toggle"><button type="button" data-kv-action="toggle" aria-pressed="false" data-part="toggle-card btn"><i data-part="icon" data-lucide="bell" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><strong>프로젝트 알림 받기</strong><small>댓글과 검토 요청이 생기면 알려드립니다.</small></span><span aria-hidden="true" data-part="toggle-indicator"></span></button><p data-part="muted">설명 영역을 포함한 버튼 전체를 누를 수 있습니다.</p></div>
